{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Zhang et al., 2025, Neural signatures of turn-induced freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease: insights from phase-specific cortico-subthalamic dynamics\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41131028\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41531-025-01173-y\",\n      \"report_says\": \"在H2中，将该研究作为STN beta ERD及步态周期beta调制失败机制的对应证据。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文主要报告PMC-STN和M1-STN相关的alpha功率及alpha coherence变化，没有发现相应的beta coherence差异。因此，该研究不能直接支持报告所提出的beta ERD机制，存在频段和信号变量错配。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Syrkin-Nikolau et al., 2017, Subthalamic neural entropy is a feature of freezing of gait in freely moving people with Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"pmid\": \"28890315\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.nbd.2017.09.002\",\n      \"report_says\": \"在H4中将该研究作为STN局部theta/delta功率变化的证据；在H11、H12中又将其熵结果与其他熵指标合并，作为STN神经活动熵增加的依据。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文的相关结果主要是alpha Sample Entropy增加，具体表现为FOG期间alpha Sample Entropy高于无冻结步行期间，并非STN局部theta/delta功率改变。此外，该研究测量的是特定频段的Sample Entropy，不能与其他研究的beta burst时间间隔Shannon entropy或Lempel-Ziv complexity视为同一种数学指标。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Pozzi et al., 2019, Freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease reflects a sudden derangement of locomotor network dynamics\",\n      \"pmid\": \"31505548\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awz141\",\n      \"report_says\": \"在H4中将该研究作为STN局部theta/delta功率变化的证据。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文的核心发现是FOG期间皮层与STN之间4–13 Hz低频（theta-alpha）耦合下降，即皮层-STN低频解耦，并非STN局部theta/delta功率改变。报告将跨脑区耦合指标误用为STN局部功率指标。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Breu et al., 2022, People With Parkinson's Disease and Freezing of Gait Show Abnormal Low Frequency Activity of Antagonistic Leg Muscles\",\n      \"pmid\": \"35153698\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.3389/fnhum.2021.733067\",\n      \"report_says\": \"在H10中将该研究作为STN活动与真实冻结事件中下肢肌肉输出时序关系的证据。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文研究的是FOG患者拮抗肌（胫骨前肌和腓肠肌）的肌电频谱活动，比较正常步行与冻结期间的肌肉活动，并考察STN-DBS和SNr-DBS的影响。研究没有同步记录STN-LFP，因此不能证明STN神经活动与真实FOG事件中下肢肌肉输出之间的同步时序关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Simpson et al., 2026, Dopamine and the dynamics of subthalamic and leg muscle activities in parkinsonian stepping\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41388789\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awaf464\",\n      \"report_says\": \"在H10中将该研究作为STN活动与真实冻结事件中下肢肌肉输出时序关系的证据。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文研究的是14名帕金森病患者在坐、站立和原地步进过程中的STN-LFP与下肢肌电动态关系，并考察左旋多巴的影响。实验没有分析真实FOG事件，因此只能支持无真实冻结事件的步进任务中的STN-EMG动态关系，不能作为冻结发生时直接神经肌肉时序关系的证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Klocke et al., 2026, Subthalamic Signatures of Freezing while Turning in Parkinson's Disease\",\n      \"pmid\": \"\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.21203/rs.3.rs-9617843/v1\",\n      \"report_says\": \"第2.3节和H3将冻结前长beta burst比例、累计持续时间或持续时间分布变化作为冻结前可重复的预测标志，后续综合没有始终严格区分冻结前与冻结期间的结果。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文明确区分Pre FoG-Turn和FoG-Turn。长burst分布增加以及burst持续时间与冻结发生显著相关（β=0.709，P=0.001）的结果出现在冻结转弯期间。冻结前转弯阶段的预测模型关联仅达到趋势水平（P=0.091），分布分析主要发现100–200 ms短burst比例下降，而不是已经证明长burst比例增加。报告将冻结期间的长burst结果与冻结前的短burst分布变化混合，可能把冻结伴随表现误当成冻结前预测标志。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Beaudoin et al., 2026, Reduced entropy of subthalamic beta bursts predicts freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease（预印本）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.64898/2026.08.13.744293\",\n      \"report_says\": \"在H11和H12中，将该研究与其他熵指标研究共同组织为STN神经活动熵增加的现象，并据此提出病理性信息失序和代偿性信息重组两种解释。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文报告的是冻结前beta burst的inter-burst interval Shannon entropy下降，而Lempel-Ziv complexity增加。也就是说，Shannon entropy实际上是下降而非增加，Lempel-Ziv complexity则是另一种数学指标。报告将不同指标、不同方向的结果混合为同一个熵增加现象，构成指标定义和结果方向上的错配。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Dutke et al., 2025, Effects of theta burst stimulation on the Parkinsonian gait disorder and cortical gait-network activity\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40383539\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1177/1877718X251320941\",\n      \"report_says\": \"在H19中以该研究支持TBS-DBS暂停期即时刺激遮蔽机制，在H20中以该研究支持长期网络可塑性及跨日适应机制。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文是15名帕金森病患者参与的单中心、随机、双盲、短期研究，TBS-DBS采用5 Hz interburst和200 Hz intraburst模式。全体患者的主要FoG-Course结局并未显示TBS-DBS优于连续DBS。研究记录的是头皮移动EEG和运动学，没有直接记录STN-LFP，也没有长期随访。因此，原文没有直接观察STN-FOG事件中的暂停期神经活动，也没有跨日或停止刺激后的可塑性证据。报告将短期刺激模式研究延伸为暂停期STN机制和长期网络可塑性机制，超出了原研究实际测量和验证的范围。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bc1e6aad-5a99-4c9a-8b89-df43fe3090d9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T070142936841Z", "elapsed_seconds": 225.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:05:28.238114+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ab4e102245262f6c0252cb34e263451d75e4db888ca8d4f8ccc1ffebd5bb42f2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T070142936841Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "62576df512b4e02395be0db8e3b08d8a37982b52c4e0fa81956a728004027837"}}}
